WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.825
An info night, an open
lecture or a workshop.

2
00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:05.555
Open Quick update.

3
00:00:05.555 --> 00:00:07.545
Press Add an info session or event.

4
00:00:07.545 --> 00:00:16.588
What it is called, and when it starts.

5
00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:20.111
Leave the kind on Choose
one for an info session.

6
00:00:20.111 --> 00:00:24.746
One or two sentences about it.

7
00:00:24.746 --> 00:00:29.704
A sign-up link becomes
a Save your seat button.

8
00:00:29.704 --> 00:00:34.938
It is on the Events page in a few minutes.
